[h2]Hey hey![/h2]

Keeping in mind the inevitable carnage that is going to happen tomorrow during the next playtest, we decided that we should roll out an update with some new stuff and fixes. Here's the list of changes:

[h3]General[/h3]
[list]
[*] Reworked post-match experience;
[*] Added “Victory” and “Defeat” messaging events to end of match;
[*] Added new post-match MVP animations;
[*] Various team balancing adjustments made;
[*] Added ball bumpers and bouncers to the [b]Coliseum[/b] map;
[*] Added Speed Boosters to El Pueblito and [b]Coliseum[/b];
[*] Updated the Boba Blaster weapon model and textures;
[/list]
[h3]Boba Ball[/h3]
[list]
[*] Increased the ball size by 2.5x;
[*] Increased the ball gravity 2.5x to prevent indefinite ball airtime with consecutive shots;
[*] Removed kill scoring and restricted points to goal scores;
[*] Added team color tracers to Boba Blaster weapon;
[*] Increased ball suction around Boba Ball goals;
[/list]
[h3]Bug Fixes[/h3]
[list]
[*] Twitch integration re-enabled in Private matches;
[*] Player spawning tweaked to prevent spawn camping in various team game modes;
[*] Added a hard squad cap to 4 players (woops);
[*] Lobby team balancing revisions.
[/list]

[b]See y'all tomorrow![/b]
